--   Freezing Arrow; druid: Ferocious Bite, Pounce Bleed, Poised, Starfall, Feral Charge (Cat); 116 spells in all, with their
--   live tooltips (hotfix_blob, enUS only);
--   239 items (Item, ItemSparse, ItemSearchName): the vanilla ground mounts and their reins/whistles, Rage of the Storm 280604
--   (new speed and damage), Gloves of Holy Might 1330855 (its proc), and Forever items such as Armorer's Gauntlets 276455;
--   37 curves and 76 curve points, modifier trees, player conditions, 8 areas, 2 holidays, a taxi path and sounds.
-- Left out: records live marks invalid or not public (status 3/4), records already imported (2026_11_06_40, 2026_11_07_40), and
-- tables the server does not serve as hotfixes (CreatureDifficulty, CooldownSetSpell, SpellScript, TradeSkillItem, QuestPOIPoint,
